window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["story-v-y2v9.5-index"]=[{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p10-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"inner","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ch 1  irreplaceable daily life reflects that the second year s winter break has begun  just being able to enjoy an ordinary holiday is best  his remaining time as a student is quietly  surely decreasing  frames the year ahead as a long  extended battle in which every day is irreplaceable   just being able to live for myself until today  i was satisfied enough   and eventually  it will come  parting  no other characters appear  the condition of  the time left for me  hangs over the volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p10-1\">Ch.1: Irreplaceable daily life<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.10<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Reflects that the second year&#x27;s winter break has begun; just being able to enjoy an ordinary holiday is best; his remaining time as a student is quietly, surely decreasing; frames the year ahead as a long, extended battle in which every day is irreplaceable.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q inner\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Just being able to live for myself until today, I was satisfied enough.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q inner\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;And eventually, it will come— Parting&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No other characters appear; the condition of &quot;the time left for me&quot; hangs over the volume.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p11-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Christmas Eve morning, Kei&#x27;s flu, Ichinose&#x27;s messages<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p11-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"karuizawa-kei ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ch 2  christmas eve morning  kei s flu  ichinose s messages wakes on the 24th with a bad dreams  kei has been out of contact since last night  their christmas morning date is off after the term s end and the rain  he called kei last night and got no answer  an hour later she called back  coughing  she said the one word  influenza  kei is bedridden  he reschedules the christmas promise and ends the call  ichinose texts about others being ill and asks about his plans  he tells her he ll go to the gym around noon   influenza  the conversation with kei happened on the 23rd and is summarized as backstory  this morning s page also notes several students across years already have confirmed cases  the cold war holds  the flu forces a reschedule  not a cancellation   both agree time matters  she texts at 9 to check on him and on kei  offers help  he says gym around noon  she proposes  it may seem like we re meeting up  as a joke","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p11-1\">Ch.2: Christmas Eve morning, Kei&#x27;s flu, Ichinose&#x27;s messages<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.11–14<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Wakes on the 24th with a bad dreams; Kei has been out of contact since last night; their Christmas morning date is off after the term&#x27;s end and the rain. He called Kei last night and got no answer; an hour later she called back, coughing: she said the one word &quot;Influenza.&quot; Kei is bedridden; he reschedules the Christmas promise and ends the call; Ichinose texts about others being ill and asks about his plans; he tells her he&#x27;ll go to the gym around noon.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Influenza.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The conversation with Kei happened on the 23rd and is summarized as backstory; this morning&#x27;s page also notes several students across years already have confirmed cases.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> The cold war holds; the flu forces a reschedule, not a cancellation — both agree time matters.<span class=\"pg\">p.11–13<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She texts at 9 to check on him and on Kei; offers help; he says gym around noon; she proposes &quot;it may seem like we&#x27;re meeting up&quot; as a joke.<span class=\"pg\">p.13–14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p10-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Irreplaceable daily life<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p15-1\">→ After: Ch.2: The gym on Christmas Eve<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka satou-maya karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  bedridden with the flu on christmas eve ayanokoji tries to call her  after an hour she calls back  coughing  with one word    influenza  she had wanted to keep the 24th promise even crawling  but he urges her to rest and reschedule  he confirms a friend has bought her everything she needs   influenza  sato calls to check on her  kei has recovered and gone out  and sato is relieved  dependent and eager to keep promises   sick as she is she still wants to meet  but she accepts rest  reschedules their christmas promise with him  her best friend checks on her flu","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1\">Kei: bedridden with the flu<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.11–13, 106<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On Christmas Eve Ayanokōji tries to call her; after an hour she calls back, coughing, with one word — &quot;Influenza.&quot; She had wanted to keep the 24th promise even crawling, but he urges her to rest and reschedule; he confirms a friend has bought her everything she needs. Satō calls to check on her; Kei has recovered and gone out, and Satō is relieved.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Influenza.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Dependent and eager to keep promises — sick as she is she still wants to meet, but she accepts rest.<span class=\"pg\">p.11–13, 106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reschedules their Christmas promise with him.<span class=\"pg\">p.11–13<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Her best friend checks on her flu.<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\">→ After: Kei: venting to Satō over the &quot;cold war&quot;<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p13-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ch 2  texts to check on him on the morning of the 24th she texts to ask after him and karuizawa s flu  offers help  asks his plans  jokes that meeting at the gym would seem deliberate  signs off with a sent back mascot  ok   good morning  ayanokoji kun  i heard that karuizawa san has the flu  are you okay   because it may seem like we re meeting up  of course  it s just a coincidence  her network is fast  already knows several students across years are ill  checks on him  he keeps his distance with a joke  she mirrors it breezily","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p13-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p13-1\">Ch.2: Texts to check on him<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.13–14<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On the morning of the 24th she texts to ask after him and Karuizawa&#x27;s flu; offers help; asks his plans; jokes that meeting at the gym would seem deliberate; signs off with a sent-back mascot &quot;OK.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Good morning, Ayanokōji-kun. I heard that Karuizawa-san has the flu. Are you okay?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.13<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Because it may seem like we&#x27;re meeting up. Of course, it&#x27;s just a coincidence!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her network is fast: already knows several students across years are ill.<span class=\"pg\">p.13<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Checks on him; he keeps his distance with a joke; she mirrors it breezily.<span class=\"pg\">p.13–14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p18-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Side-by-side treadmills<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p15-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"","w":"mashima-tomonari kouenji-rokusuke ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ch 2  the gym on christmas eve drops in at the keyaki mall gym before noon  intending a solo workout  mashima sensei is in the training room doing bench presses in class 2 a gym attire  mashima walks him through his routine  80 kg now  says 100 kg is possible  safety bars first  lifts three sets  then declines to train him personally  koenji arrives and begins training in perfect silence while others watch  koenji s form draws unconcealed awe from other members  ichinose appears  says she was late after talking with a friend  they work 30 minutes side by side on treadmills  then keep training an hour  he notices amikura has arrived to train with ichinose  he tells ichinose he s leaving  mashima   3 hours without break  calls him back to the break room   can we talk for a minute  koenji s workout draws stares and quiet commentary  koenji really is amazing  mashima sensei stops to watch him first  mashima welcomes a new face  shows him the bench  eggs him on  notices him leaving after two hours  star attraction at the gym  his effortless physical prowess draws a crowd  they run treadmills side by side in silence  she says working out together makes a difference  she starts with amikura","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p15-1\">Ch.2: The gym on Christmas Eve<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.15–19<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Drops in at the Keyaki Mall gym before noon, intending a solo workout; Mashima-sensei is in the training room doing bench presses in class-2-A gym attire. Mashima walks him through his routine (80 kg now, says 100 kg is possible, safety bars first), lifts three sets, then declines to train him personally; Kōenji arrives and begins training in perfect silence while others watch. Kōenji&#x27;s form draws unconcealed awe from other members; Ichinose appears, says she was late after talking with a friend; they work 30 minutes side by side on treadmills, then keep training an hour. He notices Amikura has arrived to train with Ichinose; he tells Ichinose he&#x27;s leaving; Mashima, ~3 hours without break, calls him back to the break room: &quot;Can we talk for a minute?&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kōenji&#x27;s workout draws stares and quiet commentary (&quot;Kōenji really is amazing&quot;); Mashima-sensei stops to watch him first.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Mashima welcomes a new face; shows him the bench, eggs him on; notices him leaving after two hours.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> Star attraction at the gym; his effortless physical prowess draws a crowd.<span class=\"pg\">p.17–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> They run treadmills side by side in silence; she says working out together makes a difference; she starts with Amikura.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p11-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Christmas Eve morning, Kei&#x27;s flu, Ichinose&#x27;s messages<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p19-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Mashima&#x27;s favor<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka akiyama mashima-tomonari","q":"mashima tomonari mashima  gym training  and a favor to investigate akiyama at the gym he is pleased to find ayanokoji is now a member  shows him his bench press routine  80 100 kg  using safety bars  trains absorbed for two hours and accepts ayanokoji s advice to stop   hm  ayanokoji  are you a gym member too   when doing bench presses  never forget these safety bars  in the break room he asks ayanokoji to investigate a gym employee  akiyama   whether she has a boyfriend  her type and hobbies   explaining he dismissed hoshinomiya and chabashira as too flirtatious serious and picked ayanokoji as discreet and trustworthy   i want you to investigate her  as carefully and discreetly as possible   you re the only one who goes to the gym  remains discreet  and seems trustworthy  cheerful and dedicated to training but secretly smitten   he delegates a discreet investigation rather than confess himself  showing a calculating side behind the simple enthusiasm  gym buddy whom he trusts with a personal favor  the gym employee he is interested in  asks ayanokoji to investigate her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html#sc-mashima-tomonari-y2v9_5-p15-1\">Mashima: gym training, and a favor to investigate Akiyama<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.15–23<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the gym he is pleased to find Ayanokōji is now a member, shows him his bench-press routine (80–100 kg, using safety bars), trains absorbed for two hours and accepts Ayanokōji&#x27;s advice to stop. In the break room he asks Ayanokōji to investigate a gym employee, Akiyama — whether she has a boyfriend, her type and hobbies — explaining he dismissed Hoshinomiya and Chabashira as too flirtatious/serious and picked Ayanokōji as discreet and trustworthy.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html\">Akiyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;Hm? Ayanokōji? Are you a gym member too?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.15<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;When doing bench presses, never forget these safety bars.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;I want you to investigate her. As carefully and discreetly as possible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re the only one who goes to the gym, remains discreet, and seems trustworthy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful and dedicated to training but secretly smitten — he delegates a discreet Investigation rather than confess himself, showing a calculating side behind the simple enthusiasm.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Gym buddy whom he trusts with a personal favor.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Akiyama<\/b> The gym employee he is interested in; asks Ayanokōji to investigate her.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9_5-p17-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2  gym showcase at christmas eve arrives at the gym and begins training  draws unconcealed attention from other members  high schoolers and adults  for his obvious physical prowess  mashima sensei stops his own set to watch  nobody dares to approach  his form is efficient and his usual eccentricity absent  others murmur that he s  always very popular  the page draws the contrast pointedly  koenji is not just unusual  he s the biggest draw in the building  observed from a distance  the two never interact here","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9_5-p17-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html#sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9_5-p17-1\">Ch.2: Gym showcase at Christmas Eve<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.17–18<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Arrives at the gym and begins training; draws unconcealed attention from other members (high schoolers and adults) for his obvious physical prowess; Mashima-sensei stops his own set to watch. Nobody dares to approach; his form is efficient and his usual eccentricity absent; others murmur that he&#x27;s &quot;always very popular.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The page draws the contrast pointedly: Kōenji is not just unusual, he&#x27;s the biggest draw in the building.<span class=\"pg\">p.17–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Observed from a distance; the two never interact here.<span class=\"pg\">p.17–18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p18-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ch 2  side by side treadmills greets him at the gym  explains she arrived late after talking with a friend  they run 30 minutes side by side without talking  trains another hour  he leaves after she appears with amikura   that might be true  in that sense  starting with amikura was the right choice  christmas eve is lost on boys  quiet 30 minute silence is her idea of companionable  works out beside him in near silence  he s just another training partner to her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p18-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p18-1\">Ch.2: Side-by-side treadmills<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.18–19<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Greets him at the gym, explains she arrived late after talking with a friend; they run 30 minutes side by side without talking; trains another hour; he leaves after she appears with Amikura.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;That might be true. In that sense, starting with Amikura was the right choice.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Christmas Eve is lost on boys; quiet 30-minute silence is her idea of companionable.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Works out beside him in near-silence; he&#x27;s just another training partner to her.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–19<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p13-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Texts to check on him<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p37-1\">→ After: Ch.3: The morning call about Karuizawa<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p19-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"mashima-tomonari akiyama ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ch 2  mashima s favor mashima asks him to the break room   can we talk for a minute    his mood is off  akiyama passes by  compliments mashima on working too hard  knows ayanokoji by sight from the reception  mashima confesses he has feelings for akiyama san  the gym staff member  dismisses hoshinomiya  too lighthearted  and chabashira  too serious  as candidates  asserts she can t be like them  asks ayanokoji to investigate her boyfriend status  her type and hobbies   carefully and discreetly  ayanokoji accepts  expecting little  mashima says there is no rush since akiyama has already seen them together  mashima is eerily composed about it  methodical  exactly the discreet method he wanted   i want you to investigate her  as carefully and discreetly as possible   well  then there was no other way to describe it  mashima claims knowing both chabashira and hoshinomiya  since we were students  and says neither could become his partner  asks a student  not a colleague  to quietly investigate a staff member he likes  the gym employee at the center of the favor  greets mashima  knows ayanokoji by sight","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p19-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p19-1\">Ch.2: Mashima&#x27;s favor<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.19–23<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mashima asks him to the break room: &quot;Can we talk for a minute?&quot; — his mood is off; Akiyama passes by, compliments Mashima on working too hard, knows Ayanokōji by sight from the reception. Mashima confesses he has feelings for Akiyama-san, the gym staff member; dismisses Hoshinomiya (too lighthearted) and Chabashira (too serious) as candidates; asserts she can&#x27;t be like them; asks Ayanokōji to investigate her boyfriend status, her type and hobbies — carefully and discreetly. Ayanokōji accepts, expecting little; Mashima says there is no rush since Akiyama has already seen them together; Mashima is eerily composed about it, methodical, exactly the discreet method he wanted.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html\">Akiyama<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> &quot;I want you to investigate her. As carefully and discreetly as possible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> &quot;Well, then there was no other way to describe it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Mashima claims knowing both Chabashira and Hoshinomiya &quot;since we were students&quot; and says neither could become his partner.<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> Asks a student, not a colleague, to quietly investigate a staff member he likes.<span class=\"pg\">p.15–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Akiyama<\/b> The gym employee at the center of the favor; greets Mashima; knows Ayanokōji by sight.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p15-1\">← Before: Ch.2: The gym on Christmas Eve<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p26-1\">→ After: Ch.2: Shiranami intercepts him in the rental shop<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-akiyama-y2v9_5-p20-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"mashima-tomonari akiyama","q":"akiyama akiyama  the gym employee mashima is smitten with named and briefly on site   a gym employee who checks that mashima has not overworked himself  notices ayanokoji with him  and says they have met at the reception before  mashima later asks ayanokoji to investigate her   mashima san  you overworked yourself again today  didn t you  attentive to mashima s training  the object of his unspoken interest  he asks ayanokoji to investigate whether she has a boyfriend and her tastes","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-akiyama-y2v9_5-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html#sc-akiyama-y2v9_5-p20-1\">Akiyama: the gym employee Mashima is smitten with<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.20–23<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/akiyama.html\">Akiyama<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named and briefly on-site — a gym employee who checks that Mashima has not overworked himself, notices Ayanokōji with him, and says they have met at the reception before; Mashima later asks Ayanokōji to investigate her.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/mashima-tomonari.html\">Mashima Tomonari<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Akiyama<\/b> &quot;Mashima-san, you overworked yourself again today, didn&#x27;t you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Attentive to Mashima&#x27;s training; the object of his unspoken interest.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mashima Tomonari<\/b> He asks Ayanokōji to investigate whether she has a boyfriend and her tastes.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p26-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"","w":"shiranami-chihiro ichinose-honami ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ch 2  shiranami intercepts him in the rental shop spots shiranami chihiro in the rental shop music corner wearing headphones to a heartbreak song  she startles  takes them off  and asks wary questions  he leaves  then she calls after him wanting time  she pulls him to a vending machine rest area  refuses a drink and a seat  and asks point blank whether his relationship with honami chan is more than classmates  she probes his feelings  mentions the rumors  alone at the gym  kei  her room  accepts his answers with halting apologies  he answers honestly but with insurance  wishing her no grief  she admits she is  an unpleasant girl  after profuse apologies  80  apology  20  explanation  she trails off  he lets her finish  they part  he startles her  she redirects the same nervous energy at ichinose  he deflects with honesty and insurance rather than comfort  she surveils his relationship with honami chan  he tells her the truth   nothing beyond classmates   but carefully","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p26-1\">Ch.2: Shiranami intercepts him in the rental shop<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.26–35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Spots Shiranami Chihiro in the rental-shop music corner wearing headphones to a heartbreak song; she startles, takes them off, and asks wary questions; he leaves, then she calls after him wanting time. She pulls him to a vending-machine rest area, refuses a drink and a seat, and asks point blank whether his relationship with Honami-chan is more than classmates. She probes his feelings, mentions the rumors (alone at the gym, Kei, her room), accepts his answers with halting apologies; he answers honestly but with insurance, wishing her no grief; she admits she is &quot;an unpleasant girl.&quot; After profuse apologies (80% apology, 20% explanation) she trails off; he lets her finish; they part.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> He startles her; she redirects the same nervous energy at Ichinose; he deflects with honesty and insurance rather than comfort.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> She surveils his relationship with Honami-chan; he tells her the truth — nothing beyond classmates — but carefully.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p19-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Mashima&#x27;s favor<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p36-1\">→ After: Ch.3: The morning; the Keyaki Mall sale; Kiryūin<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami shiranami-chihiro","q":"shiranami chihiro shiranami  a heartbreak song and questions about ichinose ayanokoji finds her in a rental shop wearing headphones  listening to a melancholic heartbreak song  startled  she takes them off and asks what he wants   w w what do you want  she asks to talk somewhere that won t stand out  then leads him to a vending machine rest area where she keeps a deliberate distance and refuses a drink or a seat   um  do you have a little time  right now  she presses him on his relationship with ichinose   are they just friends  is there romance   and voices the rumors about the gym and his room  she reveals she feels she has been  an unpleasant girl  for venting   what is your relationship with honami chan  ayanokoji kun   i m kind of an unpleasant girl  huh  she thanks him for helping her during the uninhabited island exam and stammers that it isn t that she dislikes him  jealous and lovesick over ichinose  but self aware and apologetic   she is careful not to be seen with a boy  yet desperate to confirm ayanokoji s feelings  questions him closely about ichinose  trusts him enough to ask  worried that ichinose is falling for ayanokoji  brings up the gym room rumors","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html#sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1\">Shiranami: a heartbreak song and questions about Ichinose<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.26–35<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji finds her in a rental shop wearing headphones, listening to a melancholic heartbreak song; startled, she takes them off and asks what he wants. She asks to talk somewhere that won&#x27;t stand out, then leads him to a vending-machine rest area where she keeps a deliberate distance and refuses a drink or a seat. She presses him on his relationship with Ichinose — are they just friends, is there romance — and voices the rumors about the gym and his room; she reveals she feels she has been &quot;an unpleasant girl&quot; for venting. She thanks him for helping her during the uninhabited island exam and stammers that it isn&#x27;t that she dislikes him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;W-w-what do you want?!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Um... do you have a little time... right now...?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.29<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;What is your relationship with Honami-chan, Ayanokōji-kun?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m kind of an unpleasant girl, huh?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.34<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Jealous and lovesick over Ichinose, but self-aware and apologetic — she is careful not to be seen with a boy, yet desperate to confirm Ayanokōji&#x27;s feelings.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Questions him closely about Ichinose; trusts him enough to ask.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–35<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Worried that Ichinose is falling for Ayanokōji; brings up the gym/room rumors.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–35<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1\">→ After: Shiranami: the library outing and Kamuro&#x27;s warning<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p36-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"kiryuin-fuuka ichinose-honami hondo-ryotaro nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka","q":"ayanokoji kiyotaka ch 3  the morning  the keyaki mall sale  kiryuin wakes  opens the curtains on falling snow  makes coffee  sees keyaki mall s pre christmas web ads  wants a yogurt maker at the sale price  doubts mention of a limited stock special  ichinose calls to ask about keyaki mall  tells him the school flu advisory  offers support  hangs up  he resolves to go at 10 a m  first in line  seven students present  no classmate  hondo was hyped in the group chat but didn t show up  confused  misread date  concludes it was today  leaves at the 10 a m  open  hears that last year a class b girl was injured in the opening rush  staff now control the north exit  he misses the yogurt maker   sold out   passes the supermarket dairy aisle  can t bring himself to leave  kiryuin finds him in a trance  she explains the internet price  talks through class a  the school s ban on repeating a year  her grandfather  her future  probes him about repeating  privilege and freedom  warns him to watch the third term  she starts to leave  stops  and predicts they will meet again somewhere    soon in the future   if there was a system to repeat a grade in this school  her call feels caring and slightly purposeful  he stays noncommittal  chat hype over  the first years ignore the sale  she follows him from curiosity  your hunched over back  he listens  learns her plan  a normal life funded by herself  she hints that the third term may bring trouble","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p36-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html#sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p36-1\">Ch.3: The morning; the Keyaki Mall sale; Kiryūin<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.36–58<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Wakes, opens the curtains on falling snow; makes coffee; sees Keyaki Mall&#x27;s pre-Christmas web ads; wants a yogurt maker at the sale price; doubts mention of a limited-stock special. Ichinose calls to ask about Keyaki Mall; tells him the school flu advisory; offers support; hangs up; he resolves to go at 10 a.m. First in line; seven students present; no classmate; Hondō was hyped in the group chat but didn&#x27;t show up (confused; misread date; concludes it was today); leaves at the 10 a.m. open. Hears that last year a Class B girl was injured in the opening rush; staff now control the north exit; he misses the yogurt maker — sold out — passes the supermarket dairy aisle; can&#x27;t bring himself to leave. Kiryūin finds him in a trance. She explains the internet price, talks through Class A, the school&#x27;s ban on repeating a year, her grandfather, her future; probes him about repeating, privilege and freedom; warns him to watch the third term. She starts to leave, stops, and predicts they will meet again somewhere — &quot;soon in the future.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;If there was a system to repeat a grade in this school.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> Her call feels caring and slightly purposeful; he stays noncommittal.<span class=\"pg\">p.37–38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">hondo-ryotaro<\/b> Chat hype over; the first-years ignore the sale.<span class=\"pg\">p.40<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> She follows him from curiosity (&quot;your hunched-over back&quot;); he listens, learns her plan: a normal life funded by herself.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> She hints that the third term may bring trouble.<span class=\"pg\">p.55–56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ayanokouji-kiyotaka-y2v9_5-p26-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Shiranami intercepts him in the rental shop<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p37-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ch 3  the morning call about karuizawa she calls ayanokoji in the 9 a m  hour on the 25th  asks whether he s going to keyaki mall for the sale  says school issued a flu advisory  offers to support both him and karuizawa san  he promises nothing   good morning  is it okay if i call you later  will it bother you   if you ever need help  just let me know  i want to support you and karuizawa san  he cannot figure out what she actually wanted on the call  it ends soon  reaches out with support  he gives practical answers and no commitment","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p37-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p37-1\">Ch.3: The morning call about Karuizawa<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.37–38<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She calls Ayanokōji in the 9 a.m. hour on the 25th, asks whether he&#x27;s going to Keyaki Mall for the sale; says school issued a flu advisory; offers to support both him and Karuizawa-san; he promises nothing.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Good morning. Is it okay if I call you later? Will it bother you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;If you ever need help, just let me know. I want to support you and Karuizawa-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He cannot figure out what she actually wanted on the call; it ends soon.<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reaches out with support; he gives practical answers and no commitment.<span class=\"pg\">p.37–38<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p18-1\">← Before: Ch.2: Side-by-side treadmills<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1\">→ After: Ichinose: the 46-photo memory day at Keyaki Mall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9_5-p45-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kiryuin-fuuka","q":"kiryuin fuuka ch 3  kiryuin at the mall  the yogurt maker exchange finds ayanokoji staring at the supermarket s dairy section  hunched over and bereft over the sold out yogurt maker from the keyaki mall sale  walks him out of his daze  laughs at his loss  advises buying online  shows him the same model at the same price as the sale  reveals she knew it wasn t a real sale  reveals she followed him only from curiosity about his unusual name  confesses that she once wanted to repeat a grade to keep watching him train  declines even 20 million private points to rush to class a  says private points can t buy everything  e g  she remarks she once tried to use points to fire the teachers she didn t like   no comment  reveals she was a grandchild raised by her ojii sama  ojou sama  at home  picked this school to escape being born into wealth  plans scholarship   part time to live a normal unremarkable life   like his  says nagumo is gathering rumors of second years for the third term  that the special exam ahead might be more troublesome than he thinks  her memory of last year s second term special exam is oddly vague  they part   before feeling down  try looking online  you might find it surprisingly cheap   if there was a system to repeat a grade in this school   this is just my intuition  but i have a feeling that we ll meet again somewhere  follows him to the mall  talks about privilege  class a and self funded lives  he listens but reveals nothing  mutual respect under the odds  her  failure  to join any class battle teams her with a person who genuinely doesn t care about rank","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9_5-p45-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html#sc-kiryuin-fuuka-y2v9_5-p45-1\">Ch.3: Kiryūin at the mall; the yogurt-maker exchange<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.45–58<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kiryuin-fuuka.html\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Finds Ayanokōji staring at the supermarket&#x27;s dairy section, hunched-over and bereft over the sold-out yogurt maker from the Keyaki Mall sale; walks him out of his daze. Laughs at his loss, advises buying online; shows him the same model at the same price as the sale; reveals she knew it wasn&#x27;t a real sale; reveals she followed him only from curiosity about his unusual name. Confesses that she once wanted to repeat a grade to keep watching him train; declines even 20 million private points to rush to Class A; says private points can&#x27;t buy everything (e.g. she remarks she once tried to use points to fire the teachers she didn&#x27;t like — no-comment). Reveals she was a grandchild raised by her ojii-sama (&quot;ojou-sama&quot; at home); picked this school to escape being born into wealth; plans scholarship + part-time to live a normal unremarkable life — like his. Says Nagumo is gathering rumors of second-years for the third term, that the special exam ahead might be more troublesome than he thinks; her memory of last year&#x27;s second-term special exam is oddly vague; they part.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;Before feeling down, try looking online. You might find it surprisingly cheap.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;If there was a system to repeat a grade in this school.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kiryuin Fuuka<\/b> &quot;This is just my intuition, but I have a feeling that we&#x27;ll meet again somewhere.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Follows him to the mall, talks about privilege, Class A and self-funded lives; he listens but reveals nothing; mutual respect under the odds.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Her &quot;failure&quot; to join any class battle teams her with a person who genuinely doesn&#x27;t care about rank.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–58<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiranami-chihiro nanase-tsubasa ichinose-honami","q":"ichinose honami ichinose  the 46 photo memory day at keyaki mall on christmas she takes photos with everyone at keyaki mall   43 people by one count  eventually 46   and shyly asks ayanokoji for a photo together  to make memories  careful that many photos  not just one with a boy  avoid a rift with kei   hey  ayanokoji kun  could you take a picture with me   to make some memories  i took pictures with various people here today  she asks after ayanokoji s meeting with chihiro the day before  and is joined by nanase and hosen  she waves him off as she smoothly turns to the next photo request   by the way  ayanokoji kun  you met with chihiro chan yesterday  right  cheerful  sociable and principled   she turns the holiday into a memory making marathon and cleverly protects both herself and ayanokoji from rumors by keeping the photos public  takes a commemorative photo with him  asks about his talk with shiranami  refers to her as  chihiro chan  showing closeness  joins for a photo  nanase also brings hosen","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html#sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p59-1\">Ichinose: the 46-photo memory day at Keyaki Mall<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.59–65<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ichinose-honami.html\">Ichinose Honami<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On Christmas she takes photos with everyone at Keyaki Mall — 43 people by one count, eventually 46 — and shyly asks Ayanokōji for a photo together &quot;to make memories,&quot; careful that many photos (not just one with a boy) avoid a rift with Kei. She asks after Ayanokōji&#x27;s meeting with Chihiro the day before, and is joined by Nanase and Hōsen; she waves him off as she smoothly turns to the next photo request.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;Hey, Ayanokōji-kun, could you take a picture with me?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;To make some memories, I took pictures with various people here today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.61<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ichinose Honami<\/b> &quot;By the way, Ayanokōji-kun, you met with Chihiro-chan yesterday, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cheerful, sociable and principled — she turns the holiday into a memory-making marathon and cleverly protects both herself and Ayanokōji from rumors by keeping the photos public.<span class=\"pg\">p.59–65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Takes a commemorative photo with him; asks about his talk with Shiranami.<span class=\"pg\">p.61–63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> Refers to her as &quot;Chihiro-chan,&quot; showing closeness.<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> Joins for a photo; Nanase also brings Hōsen.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-ichinose-honami-y2v9_5-p37-1\">← Before: Ch.3: The morning call about Karuizawa<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shinohara-satsuki ike-kanji","q":"ike kanji ike  defending ayanokoji in the class meeting at maezono s gathering he defends ayanokoji as no troublemaker  insists he isn t just gloomy since he dates karuizawa  and even offers to test his fighting ability with a sneak attack  shinohara and maezono shoot him down  he studies the displayed oaa with a serious expression   who knows  i m pretty confident in my fighting skills  loyal and defensive of ayanokoji  but his bluster about fighting is exposed as empty  defends him against the group s suspicion  she tells him to sit down  exasperated by his posturing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ike-kanji-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html#sc-ike-kanji-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Ike: defending Ayanokōji in the class meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Maezono&#x27;s gathering he defends Ayanokōji as no troublemaker, insists he isn&#x27;t just gloomy since he dates Karuizawa, and even offers to test his fighting ability with a sneak attack; Shinohara and Maezono shoot him down.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> &quot;Who knows? I&#x27;m pretty confident in my fighting skills.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He studies the displayed OAA with a serious expression.<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Loyal and defensive of Ayanokōji, but his bluster about fighting is exposed as empty.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Defends him against the group&#x27;s suspicion.<span class=\"pg\">p.68–76<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> She tells him to sit down, exasperated by his posturing.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-maezono-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki ike-kanji maezono","q":"maezono maezono  the secret meeting to size up ayanokoji she gathers a small group  ike  sudo  shinohara  matsushita  mori  wang  maezono  onodera  at keyaki mall  deliberately excluding karuizawa and her close friends  and opens the discussion of ayanokoji   whom she says she dislikes as  dark and hard to get along with   to be honest  perhaps it s problematic for me to say this  but i don t like   that s true  but i don t like dark and hard to get along with people  i feel  she argues his oaa understates his real ability  he solved hard questions in the special exam  was fast in the relay  is a strategic threat  warns that he named sakura for expulsion  and opposes making him the class s leader   though she cannot name an alternative   i heard this from someone else  but  during the uninhabited island exam   i strongly oppose ayanokoji kun being the leader  perceptive and outspoken   she sees through ayanokoji s facade and organizes the meeting to decide how the class should treat him  but remains evasive when asked for her own preferred leader  the subject of the meeting  she senses he is  hiding  something  co organizer who agrees with her  defends ayanokoji  she challenges him sharply","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-maezono-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html#sc-maezono-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Maezono: the secret meeting to size up Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–80<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She gathers a small group (Ike, Sudō, Shinohara, Matsushita, Mori, Wang, Maezono, Onodera) at Keyaki Mall, deliberately excluding Karuizawa and her close friends, and opens the discussion of Ayanokōji — whom she says she dislikes as &quot;dark and hard-to-get-along-with.&quot; She argues his OAA understates his real ability (he solved hard questions in the special exam, was fast in the relay, is a strategic threat), warns that he named Sakura for expulsion, and opposes making him the class&#x27;s leader — though she cannot name an alternative.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;To be honest, perhaps it&#x27;s problematic for me to say this, but I don&#x27;t like...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;That&#x27;s true, but I don&#x27;t like dark and hard-to-get-along-with people... I feel&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.68<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;I heard this from someone else, but... during the uninhabited island exam&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I strongly oppose Ayanokōji-kun being the leader.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Perceptive and outspoken — she sees through Ayanokōji&#x27;s facade and organizes the meeting to decide how the class should treat him, but remains evasive when asked for her own preferred leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–80<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The subject of the meeting; she senses he is &quot;hiding&quot; something.<span class=\"pg\">p.68–79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> Co-organizer who agrees with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Defends Ayanokōji; she challenges him sharply.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"maezono ike-kanji matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita  in on maezono s ayanokoji meeting she attends maezono s secret gathering  nods along as the group questions whether ayanokoji is really just a gloomy classmate  and sides with maezono in challenging ike s defense of him   ahem  thank you everyone for gathering today   lately  you ve been talking to ayanokoji a lot  haven t you  when did you  a participant in the class s attempt to understand ayanokoji  she notes his changed interactions and presses ike on his closeness to him  attends the meeting she called  questions his recent frequent contact with ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html#sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Matsushita: in on Maezono&#x27;s Ayanokōji meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–77<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She attends Maezono&#x27;s secret gathering, nods along as the group questions whether Ayanokōji is really just a gloomy classmate, and sides with Maezono in challenging Ike&#x27;s defense of him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;Ahem, thank you everyone for gathering today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> &quot;Lately, you&#x27;ve been talking to Ayanokōji a lot, haven&#x27;t you? When did you...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A participant in the class&#x27;s attempt to understand Ayanokōji; she notes his changed interactions and presses Ike on his closeness to him.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Attends the meeting she called.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Questions his recent frequent contact with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji shinohara-satsuki","q":"shinohara satsuki shinohara  in on the ayanokoji discussion she attends maezono s gathering  is teased about the public  lovey dovey  display with ike  and bluntly tells him off when he postures about fighting ayanokoji   you ve never been in a proper fight  have you  pragmatic and unimpressed by ike s bravado  shuts down his fighting boast","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html#sc-shinohara-satsuki-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Shinohara: in on the Ayanokōji discussion<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–77<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She attends Maezono&#x27;s gathering, is teased about the public &quot;lovey-dovey&quot; display with Ike, and bluntly tells him off when he postures about fighting Ayanokōji.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;ve never been in a proper fight, have you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pragmatic and unimpressed by Ike&#x27;s bravado.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Shuts down his fighting boast.<span class=\"pg\">p.76<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sudou-ken-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka onodera maezono sudou-ken","q":"sudo ken sudo  defending ayanokoji s ability in the class meeting at maezono s secret gathering he reveals he once fought ayanokoji and lost  argues his physical ability and speed exceed even his own  and defends the sakura expulsion as an unavoidable decision  his classmates notice how much more mature his speech has become   you guys saw it too  right  ayanokoji s speed in the relay race  he s faster   if i can beat him in anything  it s probably just basketball  and even then   i mean  if it was the previous sudo kun  you wouldn t have been able to say  candid and fair   he acknowledges ayanokoji s superiority without jealousy and has matured enough to reason about his decisions and notice others  growth  lost a fight to him  credits his speed and overall ability  onodera agrees that his speech has matured and looks pleased on his behalf  discusses whether ayanokoji should lead the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sudou-ken-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html#sc-sudou-ken-y2v9_5-p66-1\">Sudō: defending Ayanokōji&#x27;s ability in the class meeting<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–78<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Maezono&#x27;s secret gathering he reveals he once fought Ayanokōji and lost, argues his physical ability and speed exceed even his own, and defends the Sakura expulsion as an unavoidable decision; his classmates notice how much more mature his speech has become.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/onodera.html\">Onodera<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;You guys saw it too, right? Ayanokōji&#x27;s speed in the relay race. He&#x27;s faster...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;If I can beat him in anything, it&#x27;s probably just basketball. And even then...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.75<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> &quot;I mean, if it was the previous Sudō-kun, you wouldn&#x27;t have been able to say...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Candid and fair — he acknowledges Ayanokōji&#x27;s superiority without jealousy and has matured enough to reason about his decisions and notice others&#x27; growth.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Lost a fight to him; credits his speed and overall ability.<span class=\"pg\">p.74–75<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Onodera<\/b> Onodera agrees that his speech has matured and looks pleased on his behalf.<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Discusses whether Ayanokōji should lead the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9_5-p80-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"kamuro-masumi ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori hashimoto-masayoshi","q":"hashimoto masayoshi hashimoto  eavesdropping and probing ayanokoji he tells kamuro he eavesdropped on class 2 d s discussion of ayanokoji  concluding horikita is not really the core of class b and that ayanokoji can make ruthless decisions   horikita isn t the core of class b after all  in the new year group outing with hiyori  kamuro and kito  he teases hiyori  tries to hit on her  then questions ayanokoji about whether he will ditch kei for her and whether he is class b s  true leader  and proposes class a headhunt him   so  do you plan to ditch karuizawa and switch to shiina   show us  ayanokoji  if you prove your strength to us in class a  we ll use  nosy and provocative   he gathers intel on rivals and openly tests ayanokoji s loyalties and strength  acting as class a s mood maker instigator  his partner in eavesdropping and the outing  she repeatedly rebukes him  probes his relationship and strength  proposes headhunting him to class a  hits on her  she is unfazed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9_5-p80-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html#sc-hashimoto-masayoshi-y2v9_5-p80-1\">Hashimoto: eavesdropping and probing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.80–81, 189–203<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He tells Kamuro he eavesdropped on Class 2-D&#x27;s discussion of Ayanokōji, concluding Horikita is not really the core of Class B and that Ayanokōji can make ruthless decisions. In the new-year group outing with Hiyori, Kamuro and Kitō, he teases Hiyori, tries to hit on her, then questions Ayanokōji about whether he will ditch Kei for her and whether he is Class B&#x27;s &quot;true leader,&quot; and proposes Class A headhunt him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;Horikita isn&#x27;t the core of Class B after all.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;So, do you plan to ditch Karuizawa and switch to Shiina?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.200<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> &quot;Show us, Ayanokōji. If you prove your strength to us in Class A, we&#x27;ll use...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.202<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Nosy and provocative — he gathers intel on rivals and openly tests Ayanokōji&#x27;s loyalties and strength, acting as Class A&#x27;s mood-maker/instigator.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> His partner in eavesdropping and the outing; she repeatedly rebukes him.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Probes his relationship and strength; proposes headhunting him to Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.192–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Hits on her; she is unfazed.<span class=\"pg\">p.197–198<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9_5-p80-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi shiina-hiyori sakayanagi-arisu kamuro-masumi","q":"kamuro masumi kamuro  intel  warnings and probing ayanokoji she listens to hashimoto s eavesdropping report but says she already knew much of it  she is dismissive of his casual charm   i knew some of it to some extent  on the library outing she warns hiyori that being seen with ayanokoji looks abnormal  then interrogates him about snooping around class a  morishita  and says he is the only one who can influence sakayanagi   it seems like you re being quite ostentatious early in the new year   you re the only one who can influence sakayanagi  at the group outing she is impatient with hashimoto s hectoring  calls kito a  rare specimen  and leaves rather than join his  rampage  admitting she still dislikes sakayanagi but must think of the class  sharp  blunt and pragmatic   she collects and weighs information  watches appearances  and acts in class a s interest despite personal dislike of its leader  her classmate  rebukes his antics repeatedly  warns her about being seen with ayanokoji  dislikes her personally but now thinks in the class s interest","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9_5-p80-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html#sc-kamuro-masumi-y2v9_5-p80-1\">Kamuro: intel, warnings and probing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.80–81, 189–203<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She listens to Hashimoto&#x27;s eavesdropping report but says she already knew much of it; she is dismissive of his casual charm. On the library outing she warns Hiyori that being seen with Ayanokōji looks abnormal, then interrogates him about snooping around Class A (Morishita) and says he is the only one who can influence Sakayanagi. At the group outing she is impatient with Hashimoto&#x27;s hectoring, calls Kitō a &quot;rare specimen,&quot; and leaves rather than join his &quot;rampage,&quot; admitting she still dislikes Sakayanagi but must think of the class.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> &quot;I knew some of it to some extent.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.80<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> &quot;It seems like you&#x27;re being quite ostentatious early in the new year.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;re the only one who can influence Sakayanagi.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.193<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sharp, blunt and pragmatic — she collects and weighs information, watches appearances, and acts in Class A&#x27;s interest despite personal dislike of its leader.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Her classmate; rebukes his antics repeatedly.<span class=\"pg\">p.80–203<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Warns her about being seen with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Dislikes her personally but now thinks in the class&#x27;s interest.<span class=\"pg\">p.193, 203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v9_5-p113-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru katsuragi-kouhei","q":"katsuragi kohei katsuragi  the leaked warning of a dangerous third term exam ryuen summons him and ayanokoji  as they walk to the meeting he shares that ryuen calls them out unilaterally  then confides his read of the class   ryuen s strength and the  strange  students he deliberately doesn t use   trusting ayanokoji with the secret   it s a bad habit of ryuen to unilaterally call us out whenever something   you ve become quite the strategist  it seems that even ryuen trusts your  they compare sources   kiryuin of class 3 b and ibeyama of class 3 d both leaked  three days earlier  that a risky special exam may come at the start of the third term  they discuss class voting  multiple expulsions  and whom to target  then part with katsuragi offering to help if ayanokoji has problems   there will be several special exams in the third term one in early january   i owe you a lot  ayanokoji  if you have any problems  feel free to consult  serious and strategic   he shares intelligence candidly  weighing who benefits from the leak and how to protect the class  and openly values ayanokoji  trusts him with class secrets and thanks him  his class leader  summoned by him  he analyses his intentions","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v9_5-p113-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html#sc-katsuragi-kouhei-y2v9_5-p113-1\">Katsuragi: the leaked warning of a dangerous third-term exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.113–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ryūen summons him and Ayanokōji; as they walk to the meeting he shares that Ryūen calls them out unilaterally, then confides his read of the class — Ryūen&#x27;s strength and the &quot;strange&quot; students he deliberately doesn&#x27;t use — trusting Ayanokōji with the secret. They compare sources — Kiryūin of Class 3-B and Ibeyama of Class 3-D both leaked, three days earlier, that a risky special exam may come at the start of the third term; they discuss class voting, multiple expulsions, and whom to target, then part with Katsuragi offering to help if Ayanokōji has problems.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s a bad habit of Ryūen to unilaterally call us out whenever something...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;You&#x27;ve become quite the strategist. It seems that even Ryūen trusts your...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> &quot;There will be several special exams in the third term—one in early January...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I owe you a lot, Ayanokōji. If you have any problems, feel free to consult...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Serious and strategic — he shares intelligence candidly, weighing who benefits from the leak and how to protect the class, and openly values Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Trusts him with class secrets and thanks him.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> His class leader; summoned by him, he analyses his intentions.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9_5-p113-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"katsuragi-kouhei ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu ryuuen-kakeru","q":"ryuen kakeru ryuen  the summoned meeting on the third term exam he abruptly calls ayanokoji and katsuragi out to keyaki mall   ordering ayanokoji to postpone his plans   and tears into a cake when they arrive  brushing off the suggestion that he apologize   hey  answer it faster when i call   shouldn t you apologize to ayanokoji at least  he reveals he heard from third years that a big  risky exam looms at the start of the third term  he wants a one on one shot at sakayanagi in the final exam rather than a class vote  and parts telling ayanokoji their match is in the third year   in the next special exam  if the rules allow a one on one battle  i ll take on   our match will be in the third year  don t forget that  pushy and aggressive as ever   self centered in his summons  dismissive of etiquette  and intent on humiliating sakayanagi directly  his lieutenant  whom he also summons  they debate strategy  calls him out and reminds him of their pending match  wants to defeat her personally in the final exam","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9_5-p113-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html#sc-ryuuen-kakeru-y2v9_5-p113-1\">Ryūen: the summoned meeting on the third-term exam<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.113–128<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He abruptly calls Ayanokōji and Katsuragi out to Keyaki Mall — ordering Ayanokōji to postpone his plans — and tears into a cake when they arrive, brushing off the suggestion that he apologize. He reveals he heard from third-years that a big, risky exam looms at the start of the third term; he wants a one-on-one shot at Sakayanagi in the final exam rather than a class vote, and parts telling Ayanokōji their match is in the third year.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Hey, answer it faster when I call.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;Shouldn&#x27;t you apologize to Ayanokōji at least?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> &quot;In the next special exam, if the rules allow a one-on-one battle, I&#x27;ll take on...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Our match will be in the third year. Don&#x27;t forget that.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Pushy and aggressive as ever — self-centered in his summons, dismissive of etiquette, and intent on humiliating Sakayanagi directly.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> His lieutenant, whom he also summons; they debate strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Calls him out and reminds him of their pending match.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–128<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Wants to defeat her personally in the final exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.121–122<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"satou-maya ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  venting to sato over the  cold war  at keyaki mall she thanks sato for coming out  admits she told ayanokoji she is better and they agreed to talk about their promise  but worries he may have started liking ichinose   kiyotaka might actually have started to like ichinose san   it can be serious for some people  you know  sato takes her hand to make her forget the unpleasant things  kei calls her a truly good friend  still insecure about ichinose despite the recovery   she needs reassurance and leans on sato  grabs her hand  calls her a  truly good friend  fears he now likes ichinose","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\">Kei: venting to Satō over the &quot;cold war&quot;<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.123–126<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At Keyaki Mall she thanks Satō for coming out, admits she told Ayanokōji she is better and they agreed to talk about their promise, but worries he may have started liking Ichinose. Satō takes her hand to make her forget the unpleasant things; Kei calls her a truly good friend.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Kiyotaka might actually have started to like Ichinose-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;It can be serious for some people, you know.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Still insecure about Ichinose despite the recovery — she needs reassurance and leans on Satō.<span class=\"pg\">p.123–126<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Grabs her hand; calls her a &quot;truly good friend.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Fears he now likes Ichinose.<span class=\"pg\">p.124<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p11-1\">← Before: Kei: bedridden with the flu<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\">→ After: Kei: Christmas date, necklace and reconciliation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-yamamura-miki-y2v9_5-p128-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru yamamura-miki","q":"yamamura miki yamamura  tailing ayanokoji ayanokoji catches her hiding in a blind spot near a vending machine  she admits  by silence  that she has been following him for about ten minutes   and the day before as well   but he tells her ryuen and katsuragi did not notice   what are you doing in a place like that   really  i felt like ryuen kun was trying to lure me out  stealthy and anxious   she tails him out of concern about ryuen s trap and is flustered at being caught  she follows him  he calls her out gently  she fears he was trying to lure ayanokoji out","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-yamamura-miki-y2v9_5-p128-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/yamamura-miki.html#sc-yamamura-miki-y2v9_5-p128-1\">Yamamura: tailing Ayanokōji<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.128–129<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/yamamura-miki.html\">Yamamura Miki<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji catches her hiding in a blind spot near a vending machine; she admits, by silence, that she has been following him for about ten minutes — and the day before as well — but he tells her Ryūen and Katsuragi did not notice.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamamura Miki<\/b> &quot;What are you doing in a place like that?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.128<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Yamamura Miki<\/b> &quot;Really? I felt like Ryūen-kun was trying to lure me out...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Stealthy and anxious — she tails him out of concern about Ryūen&#x27;s trap and is flustered at being caught.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She follows him; he calls her out gently.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> She fears he was trying to lure Ayanokōji out.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiranami-chihiro karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  christmas date  necklace and reconciliation on their rescheduled date she meets ayanokoji at keyaki mall  still awkward after three weeks apart  and apologizes for the misunderstanding  he gives her the christmas present   the necklace she had searched for repeatedly   it s been a while   did i tell you  kiyotaka  that i wanted this  overjoyed  she asks to go back to the way things were  asks if she can really trust him  puts on the necklace and wraps her arms around him   so  it s really okay to  go back to the way things were   it s really  really okay to trust you  right  they head to karaoke  when yamamura appears at the vending machines kei links arms with him again  wanting meals  baths and sleep together as before  emotionally starved by the cold war   the necklace and his reassurance restore her completely  she is openly affectionate and wants their old closeness back  reconciles fully  accepts the necklace and asks to return to normal  spots her eavesdropping near the vending machine with a hand towel","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\">Kei: Christmas date, necklace and reconciliation<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.150–157<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On their rescheduled date she meets Ayanokōji at Keyaki Mall, still awkward after three weeks apart, and apologizes for the misunderstanding; he gives her the Christmas present — the necklace she had searched for repeatedly. Overjoyed, she asks to go back to the way things were, asks if she can really trust him, puts on the necklace and wraps her arms around him. They head to karaoke; when Yamamura appears at the vending machines Kei links arms with him again, wanting meals, baths and sleep together as before.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;It&#x27;s been a while...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.150<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Did I tell you, Kiyotaka, that I wanted this...!?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.152<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;So, it&#x27;s really okay to… go back to the way things were?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s really, really okay to trust you, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Emotionally starved by the cold war — the necklace and his reassurance restore her completely; she is openly affectionate and wants their old closeness back.<span class=\"pg\">p.150–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reconciles fully; accepts the necklace and asks to return to normal.<span class=\"pg\">p.150–157<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> Spots her eavesdropping near the vending machine with a hand towel.<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p123-1\">← Before: Kei: venting to Satō over the &quot;cold war&quot;<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1\">→ After: Kei: anxious before his &quot;one day&quot; outing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"kamuro-masumi shiina-hiyori shiranami-chihiro","q":"shiranami chihiro shiranami  the library outing and kamuro s warning at the vending machines she admits she was eavesdropping  she is  good at catching such things  and noticed he made up with kei  she stays vague about sakayanagi s reaction   please don t worry about it  you seem to have made up with karuizawa san  on the library outing she asks whether kei approved  and learns ayanokoji told her to read a book to have a common topic  kamuro warns her that being seen with him looks abnormal  and she agrees to be careful   um  was karuizawa san okay with this  i mean  is she okay with you going   today  he invited me to hang out as a friend  careful about appearances and others  opinions   she checks kei s permission and takes kamuro s warning seriously  warns her that being seen with ayanokoji looks suspicious  ayanokoji s library companion  she notes they are close","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html#sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p156-1\">Shiranami: the library outing and Kamuro&#x27;s warning<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.156–157, 187–193<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiranami-chihiro.html\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the vending machines she admits she was eavesdropping (she is &quot;good at catching such things&quot;) and noticed he made up with Kei; she stays vague about Sakayanagi&#x27;s reaction. On the library outing she asks whether Kei approved, and learns Ayanokōji told her to read a book to have a common topic; Kamuro warns her that being seen with him looks abnormal, and she agrees to be careful.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/kamuro-masumi.html\">Kamuro Masumi<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Please don&#x27;t worry about it. You seem to have made up with Karuizawa-san.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Um, was Karuizawa-san okay with this? I mean, is she okay with you going...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiranami Chihiro<\/b> &quot;Today, he invited me to hang out as a friend.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Careful about appearances and others&#x27; opinions — she checks Kei&#x27;s permission and takes Kamuro&#x27;s warning seriously.<span class=\"pg\">p.156–193<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kamuro Masumi<\/b> Warns her that being seen with Ayanokōji looks suspicious.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Ayanokōji&#x27;s library companion; she notes they are close.<span class=\"pg\">p.189, 193<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiranami-chihiro-y2v9_5-p26-1\">← Before: Shiranami: a heartbreak song and questions about Ichinose<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori hiyori  guiding ayanokoji s reading in the library at the library over the new year she greets ayanokoji and offers to guide his book choice  she starts with famous mysteries  asking if he has read the glass key  and recommends a little known author   happy new year  ayanokoji kun   then please allow me to guide your choice  helpful and quietly proud of her literary knowledge   a  bookworm girl  who takes seriously the task of picking his next read  helps him choose books  glad he will visit again","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1\">Hiyori: guiding Ayanokōji&#x27;s reading in the library<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.161–163<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">At the library over the New Year she greets Ayanokōji and offers to guide his book choice; she starts with famous mysteries (asking if he has read The Glass Key) and recommends a little-known author.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Happy New Year, Ayanokōji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.161<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Then please allow me to guide your choice.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Helpful and quietly proud of her literary knowledge — a &quot;bookworm girl&quot; who takes seriously the task of picking his next read.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Helps him choose books; glad he will visit again.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–163<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1\">→ After: Hiyori: the library outing and her father&#x27;s book<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei","q":"karuizawa kei kei  anxious before his  one day  outing she clings to him  anxious about the day long condition he set  only for today  and demands a kiss before letting him go   make sure you come back by tonight  okay   then give me a kiss  possessive and anxious   still shaken by the ichinose rumors  she needs reassurance before letting him out alone  reluctantly lets him go for the day","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html#sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p184-1\">Kei: anxious before his &quot;one day&quot; outing<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.184–185<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She clings to him, anxious about the day-long condition he set (&quot;only for today&quot;), and demands a kiss before letting him go.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Make sure you come back by tonight, okay?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> &quot;Then give me a kiss!&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Possessive and anxious — still shaken by the Ichinose rumors, she needs reassurance before letting him out alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–185<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Reluctantly lets him go for the day.<span class=\"pg\">p.184–185<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-karuizawa-kei-y2v9_5-p150-1\">← Before: Kei: Christmas date, necklace and reconciliation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei hashimoto-masayoshi shiina-hiyori","q":"shiina hiyori hiyori  the library outing and her father s book ayanokoji escorts her from the library  she asks whether kei approved of them being together  and learns he told kei to read a book so they would have a common topic   um  was karuizawa san okay with this  i mean  is she okay with you going  at the group outing with hashimoto  kamuro and kito she calls koenji like kito a  good guy  listens to the class a students probe ayanokoji  then reveals the book she gave him was written by her father  shiina katsumi   shiina katsumi  my father s name  she gives ayanokoji another of her father s books as a gift   one she had carried around daily and that is not in the library   and is anxious he will accept it  gentle  considerate and a little shy   checks kei s permission  sees good in others  and is quietly proud of her writer father while nervous about giving his book  he escorts her and recommends books  she gifts him her father s book  she is careful to check kei approved the outing  teases her and joins the group  she calls him and kito  rare specimens","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html#sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p186-1\">Hiyori: the library outing and her father&#x27;s book<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.186–207<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ayanokōji escorts her from the library; she asks whether Kei approved of them being together, and learns he told Kei to read a book so they would have a common topic. At the group outing with Hashimoto, Kamuro and Kitō she calls Kōenji-like Kitō a &quot;good guy,&quot; listens to the Class A students probe Ayanokōji, then reveals the book she gave him was written by her father, Shiina Katsumi. She gives Ayanokōji another of her father&#x27;s books as a gift — one she had carried around daily and that is not in the library — and is anxious he will accept it.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"../../../people/hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Um, was Karuizawa-san okay with this? I mean, is she okay with you going...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> &quot;Shiina Katsumi. My father&#x27;s name.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.205<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Gentle, considerate and a little shy — checks Kei&#x27;s permission, sees good in others, and is quietly proud of her writer father while nervous about giving his book.<span class=\"pg\">p.186–210<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He escorts her and recommends books; she gifts him her father&#x27;s book.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–210<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> She is careful to check Kei approved the outing.<span class=\"pg\">p.187<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> Teases her and joins the group; she calls him and Kitō &quot;rare specimens.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.197–203<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-shiina-hiyori-y2v9_5-p161-1\">← Before: Hiyori: guiding Ayanokōji&#x27;s reading in the library<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9_5-p211-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka sakayanagi-arisu","q":"sakayanagi arisu sakayanagi s new year resolve  pov  in her own viewpoint she follows reports of ayanokoji leaving the dorms with hiyori  notes karuizawa and kamuro also tailing him  and reflects that she never expected to feel something for anyone   she recognises his ability and resolves to defeat him to prove her own talent  this is sakayanagi s interior monologue  her pov  no line is quoted as spoken  cold  competitive and self aware   she admits a rare emotion toward ayanokoji and turns it into a goal to beat him  she has him followed and resolves to defeat him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9_5-p211-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\"><a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html#sc-sakayanagi-arisu-y2v9_5-p211-1\">Sakayanagi&#x27;s new-year resolve (POV)<\/a><\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.211–216<\/span><span class=\"by\">notes on <a href=\"../../../people/sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In her own viewpoint she follows reports of Ayanokōji leaving the dorms with Hiyori, notes Karuizawa and Kamuro also tailing him, and reflects that she never expected to feel something for anyone — she recognises his ability and resolves to defeat him to prove her own talent.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"../../../people/ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> This is Sakayanagi&#x27;s interior monologue (her POV); no line is quoted as spoken.<span class=\"pg\">p.211–216<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Cold, competitive and self-aware — she admits a rare emotion toward Ayanokōji and turns it into a goal to beat him.<span class=\"pg\">p.211–216<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She has him followed and resolves to defeat him.<span class=\"pg\">p.211–216<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"}];
